  "id": "delta-opioid-receptor",
  "term": "delta opioid receptor",
  "definition": "The delta opioid receptor is a type of opioid receptor involved in pain-relieving effects. In the supplied study, pain relief produced through this receptor remained effective in a rat model of neuropathic pain and, unlike mu and kappa opioid receptor effects, did not appear to depend on microglial activation.",
